issue_context.body:
## Repro

Run the following snippet:

```js
import { chromium } from '@playwright/test';

const browser = await chromium.launch();
const page = await browser.newPage();
page.on('console', console.log);
page.on('dialog', async dialog => {
  await dialog.dismiss();
  console.log('dialog dismissed');
});
await page.evaluate(() => {
  window.onbeforeunload = e => {
    return 'Confirm closing the page';
  };
});
console.log('[node.js] will reload');
await page.evaluate(() => {
  console.log('[browser] will reload');
  window.location.reload();
  console.log('[browser] did reload');
});
console.log('[node.js] after reload');

await browser.close();
```

## Expected:

```
[node.js] will reload
[browser] will reload
dialog dismissed
[browser] did reload
[node.js] after reload
```

and the browser closes.

## Actual:

```
[node.js] will reload
[browser] will reload
dialog dismissed
[browser] did reload
```

and the browser hangs.

